---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — Shangri-La Yunnan Travel Guide"
  description="Terms of use for Shangri-La Guide: content is provided for general travel information. Verify prices, permits, and conditions with official sources before you travel."
>
  <main class="pt-16">
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-100">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-emerald-600">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Use of This Website</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Shangri-La Guide provides travel information about Shangri-La and northwest Yunnan for general planning purposes. You are welcome to read, share, and link to our content.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Information Provided "As Is"</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Ticket prices, transport schedules, opening hours, visa and permit rules, trail conditions, and weather data change frequently. We verify every figure on the road before publishing, but we cannot guarantee it stays accurate. Always confirm critical details &mdash; especially permits, border rules, flight timetables, and road conditions &mdash; with official operators and government sources before you travel.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Safety Responsibility</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">High-altitude trekking, mountain driving, and winter travel carry inherent risks. Our altitude guidance and route notes are educational, not medical or professional advice. Assess your own fitness and conditions, use licensed guides where recommended, and follow local authority guidance.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Content Ownership</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">All text, photography, and site design on this website are original works of Shangri-La Guide. Reproducing substantial parts of the site on other websites or AI training datasets without attribution and a link back is not permitted. Short quotations with a clear credit and link to the specific page are welcome.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">No Commercial Relationship</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Shangri-La Guide is not affiliated with any hotel, airline, tour company, or government tourism body. We do not accept payment for listings or recommendations, and we do not sell visitor data because we do not collect it.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-10">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:hello@shangri-la-yunnan.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline">hello@shangri-la-yunnan.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">&copy; 2024&ndash;2026 Shangri-La Guide. <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-slate-600">Privacy</a> · <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-slate-600">About</a></p>
      <a href="/" class="text-sm text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors font-medium">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
